            "title": "盤中速報 - Atlassian Corporation - Class A(TEAM-US)大跌5.1%，報133.79美元",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>Atlassian Corporation - Class A(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:TEAM:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/TEAM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">TEAM-US</a>)截至台北時間19日02:10股價下跌7.2美元，報133.79美元，跌幅5.1%，成交量1,921,807（股），盤中最高價142.90美元、最低價133.79美元。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>美股指數盤中表現</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/DJI\">道瓊指數</a>：-1%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/INX\">S&amp;P 500</a>指數：-0.24%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/IXIC\">NASDAQ</a>指數：+0.26%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/SOX\">費城半導體</a>指數：-0.63%</li></ul></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>Atlassian Corporation - Class A(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:TEAM:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/TEAM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">TEAM-US</a>)歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>近 1 週：+0.9%</li> <li>近 1 月：-27.85%</li> <li>近 3 月：-5.31%</li> <li>近 6 月：+71.44%</li> <li>今年以來：-7.52%</li></ul></section></main>",
